# Tables live on Redivis, not in git (#88), as in IRW. output/ is a build area:
# data/<t>.R writes the CSVs there, upload/red_up_eco.py validates and ships them,
# and only each table's __dataset.json (its summary, columns, side-table record
# and md5s) is tracked.
